.git
.env

# src is excluded wholesale, but the bot worker needs exactly one file out of
# it. Docker honours a negation after a directory exclude; .gitignore would
# not. Without this line the image build fails at COPY with
# "failed to compute cache key ... /src/lib/welcome-card.js: not found".
# If Dockerfile.presence ever copies another src/ file, re-include it here too.
src
!src/lib/welcome-card.js
